{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030080011762-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030153036\"/><p>油麻地有人遇襲。今晨(30日)7時37分，一對夫妻在彌敦道458號美景大廈一單位疑因離婚問題發生爭執，期間妻子情緒激動，以玻璃樽襲擊丈夫頭部。警員到場經初步調查，以涉嫌「襲擊他人造成身體傷害」拘捕一名38歲女子，頭部流血紅腫清醒的丈夫則由救護車送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:24:07.628208+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T00:00:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:20.562818+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:20.562818+00:00","content_hash":"d0fd7abcd0db54d2260c009a4f9c4b102e3b0681e179eb477139a07076283199","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}